      "method_path": [
        "Recognize that 22 is one standard deviation above the mean (since a = 3, mean = 19).",
        "Use symmetry and empirical rule: P(Y < 22) = 1 - P(Y > 22) = 1 - 0.16 = 0.84, or 0.5 + 0.34 = 0.84."
